\\t(See\\tNote\\t16) |  |  |\n| Common\\tstock | 484 | 484 |\n| Additional\\tpaid-in\\tcapital | 870 | 783 |\n| Retained\\tearnings | 9,871 | 9,288 |\n| Treasury\\tstock,\\tat\\tcost | (5,496) | (5,506) |\n| Accumulated\\tother\\tcomprehensive\\tloss\\t(See\\tNote\\t17) | (1,666) | (1,800) |\n| Total\\tPPG\\tshareholders'\\tequity | 4,063 | 3,249 |\n| Noncontrolling\\tinterests | 259 | 197 |\n| Total\\tshareholders'\\tequity | 4,322 | 3,446 |\n| Total | $15,878 | $14,382 |\n\nThe\taccompanying\tnotes\tto\tthe\tconsolidated\tfinancial\tstatements\tare\tan\tintegral\tpart\tof\tthis\tconsolidated\tstatement.\n\n# Consolidated\tStatement\tof\tShareholders'\tEquity\n\n| (Millions) | Common<br>Stock | Additional<br>Paid-In<br>Capital | Retained<br>Earnings | Treasury<br>Stock | Comprehensive<br>Loss<br>(See\tNote\t17) | Total<br>PPG | Non-<br>controlling<br>Interests | Total |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Balance,\\tJanuary\\t1,\\t2010 | $484 | $609 | $8,139 | $(4,218) | $(1,261) | $3,753 | $169 | $3,922 |\n| Net\\tincome\\tattributable\\tto\\tthe\\tcontrolling\\tand\\tnoncontrolling |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| interests | — | — | 769 | — | — | 769 | 111 | 880 |\n| Other\\tcomprehensive\\tincome,\\tnet\\tof\\ttax | — | — | — | — | (150) | (150) | 2 | (148) |\n| Cash\\tdividends | — | — | (360) | — | — | (360) | — | (360) |\n| Purchase\\tof\\ttreasury\\tstock | — | — | — | (521) | — | (521) | — | (521) |\n| Issuance\\tof\\ttreasury\\tstock | — | 77 | — | 96 | — | 173 | — | 173 |\n| Stock-based\\tcompensation\\tactivity | — | 12 | — | — | — | 12 | — | 12 |\n| Equity\\tforward\\tarrangement | — | 27 | — | (65) | — | (38) | — | (38) |\n| Dividends\\tpaid\\ton\\tsubsidiary\\tcommon\\tstock\\tto\\tnoncontrolling\\ninterests | — | — | — | — | — | — | (87) | (87) |\n| Balance,\\tDecember\\t31,\\t2010 | $484 | $725 | $8,548 | $(4,708) | $(1,411) | $3,638 | $195 | $3,833 |\n| Net\\tincome\\tattributable\\tto\\tthe\\tcontrolling\\tand\\tnonco